","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-wu052-zx-7","person_id":"nk1_x97_dax","title":"典軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036","quote":"休字叔嗣，弱冠與諸葛恪、顧譚等俱爲太子登僚友，以《漢書》授登。從中庶子轉爲右弼都尉。權常遊獵，迨幕乃歸，休上疏諫戒，權大善之，以示於昭。及登卒後，爲侍中，拜羽林都督，平三典軍事，遷揚武將軍。爲魯王霸友黨所譖，與顧譚、承俱以芍陂論功事，休、承與典軍陳恂通情，詐增其伐，並徙交州。中書令孫弘佞偽險詖，休素所忿，弘因是譖訴，下詔書賜休死，時年四十一。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0123"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-zx-7:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"典軍","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0123","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01","text":"吴录曰：全琮父子屡言芍陂之役为典军陈恂诈增张休、顾承之功，而休、承与恂通情。休坐系狱，权为谭故，沉吟不决，欲令谭谢而释之。及大会，以问谭，谭不谢，而曰：「陛下，谗言其兴乎！」","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"全琮","kind":"person","person_id":"984_9e1_5e9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"陈恂","kind":"person","person_id":"nk1_x97_dax","status":"contextual_provisional","inte